--TEST--
Testing a "from"-imported macro with "defined" using parentheses is forbidden
--TEMPLATE--
{% from _self import hello %}
{{ hello() is defined ? 'OK' : 'KO' }}
{% macro hello() %}{% endmacro %}
--DATA--
return []
--EXCEPTION--
Twig\Error\SyntaxError: Using parentheses when testing a macro with the "defined" test is not allowed; remove the parentheses after the macro name in "index.twig" at line 3.
